<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><p coords="1,141.62,159.52,375.65,10.50;1,78.00,174.52,412.00,10.50;1,78.00,189.52,238.61,10.50"><s coords="1,141.62,159.52,375.65,10.50;1,78.00,174.52,164.72,10.50">We study how sequence models can be used to check that citations in a thesis match the cited sources.</s><s coords="1,246.06,174.52,243.94,10.50;1,78.00,189.52,238.61,10.50">Experiments on a small sample set compare a recurrent baseline with a fine-tuned encoder.</s></p></div>
